    <item>
      <title>Sierra stuns East Union</title>
      <link>https://www.mantecabulletin.com/sports/high-school-sports/sierra-stuns-east-union/</link>
      <description>Handcuffed by foul trouble for much of the second half, Colby Veuve came through with the clutch plays for a Sierra team desperate for a win on Friday. In the final 30 seconds, the senior forward made five of six free throws, grabbed a big-time defensive rebound and secured a last-second steal in the Timberwolves’ 55-50 upset victory over visiting rival East Union, which came into the game part of a four-way tie for first place in the Valley Oak League.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.mantecabulletin.com/sports/high-school-sports/sierra-stuns-east-union/</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://centralca.cdn-anvilcms.net/media/images/2026/01/31/images/BBSK--East_Union-Sierra_pic_2.max-540x540.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
